.TH CFHUB 1
.SH NAME
cfhub \- Cloudflare administration CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cfhub
<command> [action] [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Use cfhub to manage Cloudflare resources, audit account data, export inventory, and call the Cloudflare API. API-token and OAuth profiles are supported.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B cfhub auth status
.br
.B cfhub zones list --json
.br
.B cfhub api /zones --json --jq '.result[].name'
.SH SEE ALSO
cfhub --help
.br
cfhub <command> --help
